{"seq":2,"slug":"comparative-law","title":"比较法学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law","introMarkdown":"# 比较法学 简介\n\n比较法学通过对不同法律体系的系统对照来深化对法律现象的理解。在全球化背景下，比较法不仅是学术研究的重要分支，更是国际法律合作、法律移植和制度改革中不可或缺的分析工具。\n\n本课程从比较法的理论基础出发，分别进入公法和私法两个领域的跨法域对比分析，最终延伸至全球法律治理的前沿议题，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**比较法基础理论**奠定进行跨法域分析的方法论基础。法系划分的经典框架提供了宏观分类工具，功能主义比较方法论指导如何寻找不同法律制度中的功能等价物，法律移植理论则分析法律规则跨境迁移的条件和机制。\n\n第二章**公法比较**在宪法和行政法领域展开跨国对照分析。宪法比较考察不同国家的权力配置和权利保障模式，行政法比较关注政府行为的法律控制机制，人权比较则审视国际人权标准在不同法律文化中的实现路径。\n\n第三章**私法比较**深入民商事法律领域的跨法域对比。合同法比较展示不同法系在意思自治和合同自由方面的制度差异，侵权法比较分析归责原则和损害赔偿的多样化方案，物权法比较则揭示财产权制度背后的社会文化根源。\n\n第四章**全球治理与法律趋同**关注法律全球化的最新发展。国际法律协调的机制和挑战、区域一体化进程中的法律融合，以及商人法等自发性法律秩序的形成，展示了法律体系在全球层面的互动与演变。\n\n建议学习者在对比分析时始终保持对制度背景差异的敏感性，避免表面化的制度比较。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"比较法基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-families","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 法系","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/foundations/legal-families"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functionalism-in-law","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 功能主义比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/foundations/functionalism-in-law"},{"seq":3,"slug":"legal-transplants","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 法律移植","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/foundations/legal-transplants"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-law","title":"公法比较","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/public-law","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constitutional-comparison","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 宪法比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/public-law/constitutional-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"administrative-law-comparison","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 行政法比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/public-law/administrative-law-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-rights-comparison","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 人权比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/public-law/human-rights-comparison"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"private-law","title":"私法比较","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/private-law","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-law-comparison","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 合同法比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/private-law/contract-law-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tort-law-comparison","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 侵权法比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/private-law/tort-law-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"property-law-comparison","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 物权法比较","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/private-law/property-law-comparison"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"global-governance","title":"全球治理与法律趋同","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/global-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"international-harmonization","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 国际协调","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/global-governance/international-harmonization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regional-integration","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 区域一体化","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/global-governance/regional-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lex-mercatoria","title":"研究生 比较法学 — 商人法","url":"/education/graduate/law/comparative-law/global-governance/lex-mercatoria"}]}]}